        "name": "Why is specialized digital marketing crucial for early-stage startups?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Startups operate under strict runway constraints where every marketing dollar must generate measurable traction. Unlike established corporations with bloated brand budgets, startups require agile growth marketing: rapid A/B creative testing, hyper-targeted CAC reduction, product-market fit validation, and conversion rate optimization (CRO) that accelerates early adopter adoption."
