        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "How do you lower Customer Acquisition Cost (CAC) for startups?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "We optimize the entire customer acquisition journey: designing high-converting dedicated landing pages, pruning underperforming ad keywords, building automated retargeting funnels, and pairing paid ads with compounding programmatic SEO to lower blended acquisition costs."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "How do you help SaaS and tech startups validate Product-Market Fit (PMF)?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "We run rapid paid experimentation campaigns on Google Search, LinkedIn, and Meta targeting distinct customer personas, measuring click-through rates, trial signup velocity, activation rates, and user feedback to pinpoint the most responsive target audience."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Can you generate enterprise B2B leads for tech and SaaS ventures?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Yes! We deploy Account-Based Marketing (ABM) on LinkedIn, high-intent Google Search PPC for bottom-of-the-funnel software evaluation keywords, and automated multi-touch email/WhatsApp nurturing workflows for high-ticket enterprise contracts."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "How does SEO benefit early-stage startups with limited domain authority?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "We implement programmatic long-tail keyword architectures and authoritative topic clusters targeting high-intent 'alternative to [competitor]' and 'best software for [use case]' queries, capturing organic buyers without needing a 10-year-old domain."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "How do you handle founder personal branding and LinkedIn thought leadership?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "We ghostwrite insightful industry breakdowns, founder journey stories, product build-in-public updates, and visionary commentary that establish the founding team as thought leaders, attracting both customers and venture capital investors."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "What analytics and attribution setup do you implement for startups?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "We set up comprehensive GA4, Google Tag Manager, Meta CAPI (Conversion API), and CRM event telemetry to track trial activations, MRR growth, cohort retention, and multi-touch attribution on real-time executive dashboards."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Do you design high-converting SaaS landing pages and onboarding flows?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Yes! We build ultra-fast, mobile-first Webflow, WordPress, and custom landing pages optimized for single-goal conversion: frictionless freemium signup, product demo booking, or interactive calculator lead capture."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "How do you market D2C and e-commerce startups?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "We combine viral UGC video ads on Meta and YouTube Shorts with dynamic catalog remarketing, Google Shopping Performance Max campaigns, and automated WhatsApp cart recovery flows to achieve a healthy 4x+ ROAS."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "How do you optimize startups for AI search engines like ChatGPT, Claude, and Gemini?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "We implement structured SoftwareApplication and Organization schemas, optimize product comparison tables, and publish deep authoritative guides so AI conversational agents cite your startup as a recommended solution."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "How fast can our startup growth campaign go live?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Our dedicated startup agile pod can design landing pages, configure tracking pixels, set up ad campaigns, and launch live traffic within 5 to 7 business days."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Can digital marketing help us prepare for our next VC funding round?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Absolutely! We focus on building clean, investor-ready traction metrics: Month-over-Month (MoM) revenue growth, declining blended CAC, healthy LTV/CAC ratios (3:1+), and predictable user acquisition funnels that impress angel investors and VCs."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "What monthly marketing packages do you offer for startups?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Our packages start at ₹49,999 (Basic Plan for bootstrapped/seed startups) up to ₹1,99,999 (Enterprise Plan for funded scale-ups requiring aggressive multi-channel market expansion across domestic and international territories)."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Do we need long-term lock-in contracts?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "No! We offer flexible month-to-month and milestone-based growth agreements designed to match dynamic startup agility and funding sprint cycles."
